# this file. Every path is served the built index.html with a 200, and
# react-router then renders the route -- /privacy-policy, /contact-us,
# /mway-app and the rest work on a direct visit or a refresh, not only when
# reached by clicking a link.
#
# No deployment platform is configured in this project, so this sits
# alongside the dist/404.html emitted by vite.config.js. On a host that does
# not read _redirects this file is inert; it is never served as a page.

